WEBVTT

00:00:16.818 --> 00:00:18.098
(ALL GASP)

00:00:27.218 --> 00:00:28.698
(ALL SIGH IN RELIEF)

00:00:30.618 --> 00:00:31.738
(EXHALES SHARPLY)

00:00:44.898 --> 00:00:46.378
(ALL CHEERING)

00:00:56.658 --> 00:00:58.378
(WIND HOWLING)

00:01:00.898 --> 00:01:02.898
(CHORUS CHANTING YOIK)

00:01:02.978 --> 00:01:04.618
(GRUNTING)

00:01:06.938 --> 00:01:08.818
-(CHITTERING)
-(CREATURE CROAKING)

00:01:13.338 --> 00:01:15.138
(CHANTING CONTINUES)

00:01:22.738 --> 00:01:24.898
I'm sorry I left you behind.

00:01:25.498 --> 00:01:28.058
I was just so desperate
to protect her.

00:01:28.218 --> 00:01:30.778
I know. I know. It's okay.

00:01:31.378 --> 00:01:32.978
My love is not fragile.

00:01:34.698 --> 00:01:35.938
Wow.

00:01:36.778 --> 00:01:38.858
Look at the sky.

00:01:39.738 --> 00:01:40.698
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:40.818 --> 00:01:43.058
I just didn't realize
there was so much of it.

00:01:43.498 --> 00:01:45.378
34 years...

00:01:45.578 --> 00:01:46.858
Five months...

00:01:47.018 --> 00:01:49.658
And 23 days.

00:01:55.138 --> 00:01:56.138
(SVEN BELLOWS)

00:01:56.218 --> 00:01:57.338
(LAUGHTER)

00:02:01.058 --> 00:02:02.458
(CHILDREN LAUGHING)

00:02:07.538 --> 00:02:09.298
(REINDEERS GRUNTING)

00:02:21.258 --> 00:02:22.338
(SIGHS)

00:02:23.898 --> 00:02:25.178
(WIND HOWLING)

00:02:26.538 --> 00:02:27.738
(GASPS)

00:02:28.378 --> 00:02:29.618
(CHITTERING)

00:02:34.898 --> 00:02:36.498
(WHINNYING IN DISTANCE)

00:02:37.978 --> 00:02:38.978
(GASPS)

00:02:39.338 --> 00:02:40.738
(CREATURE WHINNYING)

00:02:41.378 --> 00:02:42.858
(GASPING)

00:02:56.138 --> 00:02:57.138
(CREATURE CHITTERS)

00:03:00.618 --> 00:03:02.298
Is it really you?

00:03:02.458 --> 00:03:04.138
-Anna.
-(LAUGHS)

00:03:04.538 --> 00:03:05.938
(ANNA SOBBING)

00:03:06.458 --> 00:03:08.138
(SNIFFLES)
I thought I'd lost you.

00:03:08.298 --> 00:03:09.658
Lost me?

00:03:09.818 --> 00:03:12.338
You saved me. Again.

00:03:12.538 --> 00:03:13.498
I did?

00:03:13.698 --> 00:03:16.458
And, Anna,
Arendelle did not fall.

00:03:16.658 --> 00:03:18.178
(CONTINUES SOBBING)

00:03:18.538 --> 00:03:19.858
It didn't?

00:03:20.018 --> 00:03:22.178
The spirits all agreed.

00:03:22.378 --> 00:03:24.858
Arendelle deserves
to stand with you.

00:03:25.298 --> 00:03:26.618
(SNIFFS AND SNORTS)

00:03:26.698 --> 00:03:27.698
Me?

00:03:27.858 --> 00:03:30.778
You did what was right.
For everyone.

00:03:30.938 --> 00:03:32.778
Did you find the fifth spirit?

00:03:34.938 --> 00:03:37.498
(GASPS)
You are the fifth spirit.

00:03:38.098 --> 00:03:39.258
You're the bridge.

00:03:39.418 --> 00:03:42.098
Well, actually,
a bridge has two sides.

00:03:42.258 --> 00:03:44.898
And Mother had two daughters.

00:03:45.378 --> 00:03:47.258
We did this together.

00:03:47.658 --> 00:03:50.258
And we'll continue
to do this together.

00:03:51.178 --> 00:03:52.178
Together.

00:03:52.338 --> 00:03:54.338
Elsa! You're okay!

00:03:54.978 --> 00:03:56.138
(BOTH SIGH)

00:03:56.218 --> 00:03:57.978
-(ELSA CHUCKLES)
-(SVEN BELLOWS)

00:03:58.058 --> 00:03:59.578
You look different.

00:03:59.738 --> 00:04:00.898
Did you cut your hair
or something?

00:04:00.978 --> 00:04:03.538
-(CHUCKLES) Or something.
-Oh.

00:04:03.938 --> 00:04:05.738
-(WIND GUSTING)
-(CHITTERING)

00:04:07.178 --> 00:04:10.538
Anna, I need to ask you
a question.

00:04:10.698 --> 00:04:12.258
Okay.

00:04:12.498 --> 00:04:14.618
Do you want to build
a snowman?

00:04:15.218 --> 00:04:16.378
What?

00:04:19.778 --> 00:04:21.618
(CHITTERING)

00:04:29.098 --> 00:04:32.498
Thank goodness
water has memory.

00:04:33.658 --> 00:04:35.218
(GASPS, CHUCKLES)

00:04:42.698 --> 00:04:43.858
(GIGGLES)

00:04:44.538 --> 00:04:45.538
Anna.

00:04:45.938 --> 00:04:48.338
-(BOTH CHUCKLE)
-Elsa! (GRUNTS EXCITEDLY)

00:04:48.418 --> 00:04:50.538
-Kristoff! And Sven!
-(KRISTOFF CHUCKLES)

00:04:50.858 --> 00:04:53.698
(GIGGLES EXCITEDLY)
You all came back.

00:04:53.778 --> 00:04:56.698
Oh, I love happy endings.

00:04:57.178 --> 00:04:58.538
I mean, I presume we're done.

00:04:58.698 --> 00:05:01.218
Or is this "putting us
in mortal danger" situation

00:05:01.298 --> 00:05:02.858
gonna be a regular thing?

00:05:02.938 --> 00:05:04.618
(CHUCKLES) No. We're done.

00:05:04.778 --> 00:05:07.738
Actually,
there is one more thing.

00:05:08.338 --> 00:05:09.338
Anna,

00:05:09.418 --> 00:05:12.618
you are the most extraordinary
person I've ever known.

00:05:12.738 --> 00:05:13.738
(GASPS)

00:05:13.818 --> 00:05:16.618
I love you with all I am.

00:05:16.778 --> 00:05:18.018
Will you marry me?

00:05:18.258 --> 00:05:19.898
Oh. (SOBS)

00:05:19.978 --> 00:05:21.738
-Yes! (CHUCKLES)
-Ah.

00:05:22.258 --> 00:05:24.058
(SOBBING)

00:05:25.418 --> 00:05:27.338
(BOTH LAUGHING)

00:05:30.818 --> 00:05:32.418
-(SVEN BELLOWS)
-KRISTOFF: Aw.

00:05:32.498 --> 00:05:33.818
-(OLAF GASPS)
-(FOOTSTEPS THUDDING)

00:05:33.898 --> 00:05:35.378
(ANNA AND KRISTOFF GASP)

00:05:38.458 --> 00:05:39.578
(GRUNTS)

00:05:46.978 --> 00:05:48.218
Arendelle's okay.

00:05:48.378 --> 00:05:49.738
-What?
-(EXHALES)

00:05:50.618 --> 00:05:52.338
Ahtohallan is beautiful.

00:05:52.418 --> 00:05:53.778
-(CROAKING)
-Oh!

00:05:53.858 --> 00:05:55.058
(CHUCKLING) Hello.

00:05:56.098 --> 00:05:58.978
You know, you belong up here.

00:05:59.818 --> 00:06:02.818
I took an oath to always do
what's best for Arendelle.

00:06:03.898 --> 00:06:07.498
Luckily,
I know just what that is.

00:06:07.658 --> 00:06:10.218
While I still don't know
what "transformation" means...

00:06:10.418 --> 00:06:14.578
I feel like this Forest
has really changed us all.

00:06:16.258 --> 00:06:18.338
(CROWD APPLAUDING)

00:06:19.498 --> 00:06:24.938
Presenting Her Majesty,
Queen Anna of Arendelle!

00:06:25.018 --> 00:06:26.378
(ALL CHEERING)

00:06:30.978 --> 00:06:33.658
Oh! Hello. (CHUCKLES) Hi.

00:06:33.778 --> 00:06:36.418
-(SVEN GRUNTS)
-Sven, don't you look nice.

00:06:36.498 --> 00:06:37.578
(OLAF CLEARS THROAT)

00:06:37.698 --> 00:06:39.658
Oh, my goodness! Olaf!

00:06:39.818 --> 00:06:41.738
Charmed, I'm sure.

00:06:41.818 --> 00:06:43.698
(CHUCKLES) Charming.

00:06:43.778 --> 00:06:45.098
-Your Majesty.
-(GASPS)

00:06:46.578 --> 00:06:47.738
ANNA: Kristoff.

00:06:48.738 --> 00:06:51.418
Aw, did you boys
get all dressed up for me?

00:06:51.498 --> 00:06:53.178
-It was Sven's idea.
-(SVEN GRUNTS)

00:06:53.738 --> 00:06:56.538
One hour. You get this
for one hour.

00:06:56.698 --> 00:06:57.778
That's okay.

00:06:58.578 --> 00:07:00.378
I prefer you
in leather anyway.

00:07:00.458 --> 00:07:01.458
(BOTH CHUCKLE)

00:07:02.338 --> 00:07:03.858
(OLAF SHUDDERS)

00:07:03.978 --> 00:07:06.418
I'm shocked you can last
an hour. That was brutal.

00:07:06.498 --> 00:07:09.298
-(KRISTOFF GRUNTS)
-The things we do for love.

00:07:09.898 --> 00:07:11.458
What is this crazy magic
called again?

00:07:11.618 --> 00:07:12.978
A photograph.

00:07:13.138 --> 00:07:14.418
Photograph. Huh.

00:07:15.138 --> 00:07:16.218
-We look good.
-(HALIMA GIGGLES)

00:07:16.298 --> 00:07:18.218
-(HALIMA CHUCKLES)
-Halima. General Mattias.

00:07:18.378 --> 00:07:20.338
Uh, Your Majesty.
I'll be right back.

00:07:20.538 --> 00:07:23.018
You can look at our photograph
while I'm gone.

00:07:23.098 --> 00:07:25.018
(LAUGHS, SNORTS)
I'm just kidding.

00:07:25.178 --> 00:07:27.138
-How am I doing?
-ANNA: Fantastic.

00:07:31.018 --> 00:07:33.058
(CROWD EXCLAIMING
AND CHEERING)

00:07:35.778 --> 00:07:40.138
Our lands and people,
now connected by love.

00:07:43.458 --> 00:07:45.058
(CHITTERING)

00:07:46.418 --> 00:07:49.058
Hi, Gale. You like it?

00:07:49.258 --> 00:07:52.458
Oh, do you mind? I've got
a message for my sister.

